cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "passmcp-reporting: the passmcp MCP evaluation attestation format and its offline verifier"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: 0.0.3
date-released: 2026-09-30
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/passmcp-reporting"
abstract: >-
  The in-toto statement passmcp writes about one Model Context Protocol
  server — its target, what it was judged against, the verdict for every
  check that ran, and the score — with the JSON Schema of the predicate
  and a Go verifier that checks a statement offline. Licensed so that a
  gateway, registry or CI system can embed it.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - attestation
  - in-toto
  - golang
license: Apache-2.0
